<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{ inventory_hostname }} · RHEL Ansible Lab</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #1a1d21;
      --surface: #252a30;
      --surface-elevated: #2e343c;
      --text: #e8eaed;
      --text-muted: #9aa0a6;
      --accent: #5c9ce6;
      --accent-soft: rgba(92, 156, 230, 0.15);
      --border: #3d444d;
      --success: #6bcf7f;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text);
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #14171a 0%, var(--bg) 40%, #1e2328 100%);
    }

    .wrap {
      max-width: 42rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    }

    header { margin-bottom: 2rem; }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      border: 1px solid rgba(92, 156, 230, 0.35);
      padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .lead {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .meta-grid { display: grid; gap: 0.65rem; }

    .meta-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      align-items: baseline;
    }

    .meta-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      min-width: 6.5rem;
    }

    .meta-value {
      font-family: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", monospace;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      color: var(--success);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .status::before {
      content: "";
      width: 0.5rem;
      height: 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--success);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--success);
    }

    ul.achievements {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
    }

    ul.achievements li {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    ul.achievements li::marker { color: var(--accent); }

    footer {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-align: center;
    }

    code {
      font-size: 0.85em;
      background: var(--surface-elevated);
      padding: 0.12rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <span class="badge">Portfolio lab</span>
      <h1>RHEL Ansible Web Lab</h1>
      <p class="lead">Automated multi-node web tier on RHEL 9 — provisioned from a Git-backed control host.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>This host</h2>
      <div class="meta-grid">
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Hostname</span>
          <span class="meta-value">{{ inventory_hostname }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Address</span>
          <span class="meta-value">{{ ansible_host | default(ansible_default_ipv4.address | default('n/a')) }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Web stack</span>
          <span class="meta-value">{{ web_stack }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Status</span>
          <span class="meta-value"><span class="status">Serving HTTP</span></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>What this project demonstrates</h2>
      <ul class="achievements">
        <li>Three-VM lab: <strong>Control-Node</strong> plus <strong>App-Node1</strong> and <strong>App-Node2</strong> on VirtualBox (bridged networking).</li>
        <li>SSH key authentication and passwordless <code>sudo</code> for automation from the control host.</li>
        <li>Idempotent Ansible roles (<code>common</code>, <code>webserver</code>) driven by inventory and variables.</li>
        <li>One-command deploy: <code>ansible-playbook playbooks/site.yml</code> installs {{ web_stack }}, enables the service, and opens <code>http</code>/<code>https</code> in firewalld.</li>
        <li>Source of truth in GitHub; changes committed on Windows and pulled on the control node before each run.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Stack details</h2>
      <div class="meta-grid">
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Roles</span>
          <span class="meta-value">common, webserver</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Deployed</span>
          <span class="meta-value">{{ ansible_date_time.date }} {{ ansible_date_time.time }} ({{ ansible_date_time.tz }})</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      Built for cloud / platform engineering portfolio practice · RHEL {{ ansible_distribution_major_version | default('9') }}
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
